            "review_title": "Review at Dotori Dining",
            "review_text": "mia c\n3 contributions\n0\nHighly Recommended\nJun 2025 • Friends\nThis spot is great for a casual afterwork meal. \n\nAlthough the restaurant is quite small, it offers a warm and cozy atmosphere, which is perfect for catching up with friends or spending a private evening with your partner. \n\nThe tonkatsu with natto (fried pork with Japanese fermented soybean) is delicious, definitely a must-try. \n\nThe portions are generous, so be sure pace yourself - as it's easy to let your eyes get bigger than your your stomach.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten June 30, 2025",
